# Git Branching and Merge Workflow

## Branch Roles

- `development` is the default integration branch for ongoing work.
- `main` is the production branch.
- Feature, bug-fix, refactor, and other working branches must initially branch from `development`.
- `main` must never be used as the starting point for ordinary feature work.

## Branch Naming

Use descriptive branch names with lowercase kebab-case:

- `feature/<short-description>`
- `fix/<short-description>`
- `refactor/<short-description>`
- `chore/<short-description>`
- `hotfix/<short-description>`

Examples:

```text
feature/user-profile
fix/mobile-navigation
refactor/api-client
hotfix/payment-timeout
